  <entity00159616:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDeterminedOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_entity00159616_DoosanFuelCellCoLtdMemberOfEntitysTotalForCashGeneratingUnitsMemberOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">순공정가치는 평가기준일인 2025년 12월 31일의 주가에 경영권 프리미엄을 가산 후처분부대원가를 차감하여 산정하였습니다.</entity00159616:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDeterminedOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfItems>
  <entity00159616:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDeterminedOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_entity00159616_DoosanMottrolCoLtdMemberOfEntitysTotalForCashGeneratingUnitsMemberOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">사용가치는 경영진에 의해 승인된 5년간의 예산에 기초한 미래현금흐름을 추정하여계산되었으며 경영진은 과거 실적과 시장성장에 대한 예측에 근거하여 예산상 총이익을 결정하였습니다. 5년을 초과한 현금흐름은 영구성장률을 이용하여 추정하였으며 영구성장률은 현금창출단위가 운영되는 사업부문의 장기 평균 성장률을 초과하지않습니다. 또한 이는 산업보고서에 포함된 예측치와 일관된 것입니다. 사용된 할인율은 관련된 영업부문의 특수한 위험을 반영한 위험조정할인율입니다.</entity00159616:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDeterminedOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMethodAndAssumptionsToCalculateRecoverableAmountTableTableOfItems>
